      "created_at": "2016-06-23T03:22:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Turns out the \"famous lineup\" (TLT/WGL/Unity/I_Scholar/DVisionary) works pretty well against Dawn as well. Just had a game in which I kept killing her citizens and poping them out of her trash via Suggestion and Brain Burn. Never got even four citizens in the discard pile at one time. Good times.</p><p>Maybe I should come up with a name for this hero lineup. Lesse...</p><p>TWUID?</p><p>Sounds like someone with a lisp trying to say \"druid\", like the priest in Princess Bride.</p><p>Any better ideas? ;p</p>",
